Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:46.53,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\fn@AHZ6QH16\frz270\fs100\bord1\3c&HF5F5F5&\an7\pos(536,133)}铁木哥之子\N斡端
